    <div class="eyebrow">Backflow prevention testing</div>
    <h1>Your fire sprinkler system needs more than a suppression check.</h1>
    <p>Oregon law and Portland City Code require annual backflow testing on any property with a fire sprinkler system, irrigation system, or other cross-connection risk. If you're already having your suppression system inspected, your backflow assembly is due the same year.</p>
  </div>

